# (c) The countdown ends but the conversation is under 120k tokens: it is left alone.
title:   A small context is left alone
caption: The countdown runs out as usual, but the conversation holds only 64k tokens, under the 120k minimum. Re-reading something that small is cheap, so idle-compact leaves it exactly as it was.
note:    1 column = 1 minute. The minimum is the minTokens setting; set it to 0 to always compact.
focus:   s
term:    Context — everything Claude reads to answer you: the whole conversation so far.
term:    Tokens — the units a conversation is measured in; a token is roughly three quarters of a word. 64k is 64,000 tokens.

time           0    5m   10m  15m  20m
claude      -S~E-------------------------
countdown      [===================F
compaction  ------------------------s----

legend
S  message sent — you ask, Claude starts  blue
~  Claude working  teal
E  reply done — the countdown starts  teal
=  idle countdown · 20 min  violet
F  time is up — only 64k tokens  violet
s  left alone — 64k is under the 120k minimum  amber
